<title>CROATIA: Croatia shows $3.28 bln trade deficit in '96.</title>
<headline>Croatia shows $3.28 bln trade deficit in '96.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Bureau of Statistics issued the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p>CROATIA MERCHANDISE TRADE Jan-Dec'96  Jan-Dec'95  pct change</p>
<p> balance (million USD)	 -3,276	-2,877	+13.9</p>
<p> exports			    4,511	 4,632	 -2.6</p>
<p> imports			    7,787	 7,509	 +3.7</p>
<p>NOTES -- The figures are cumulative. Month on month figures for December expected later this week.</p>
<p>-- Zagreb Newsroom, 385-1-4551-840</p>
</text>
